{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.7.68.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77134,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65e1592d04aea49735f6cf60e1abbac2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"soitsmox\" post=\"1866376\" timestamp=\"1408038787\"]\nHi all! We will be getting married in April 2016. I couldn&#039;t find a 2016 forum so I thought posting here would be beneficial. I am actually calling to book at Beaches T&amp;amp;C resort tomorrow morning to get started on our wedding planning process.\n \nDoes anyone have any idea what the average price is for guests of the wedding?[\/quote]\n\nHi!  Are you asking costs for the guests to pay for travel or cost that you will pay for your guests (dinner, open bar, etc.)?","Attachments":[],"Id":1868452,"PostDate":1408848783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>soitsmox, on 14 August 2014 - 09:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi all! We will be getting married in April 2016. I couldn't find a 2016 forum so I thought posting here would be beneficial. I am actually calling to book at Beaches T&C resort tomorrow morning to get started on our wedding planning process.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nDoes anyone have any idea what the average price is for guests of the wedding?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br><br>\nHi!  Are you asking costs for the guests to pay for travel or cost that you will pay for your guests (dinner, open bar, etc.)?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megthomson78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.76.163.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388753198,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275858.jpg?_r=1394079727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megthomson","Id":275858,"Name":"megthomson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.173.225.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77134,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db59b05977c2da99495ffd3744691bbf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"AK15\"]! How is the wedding planning going?&amp;nbsp;Have you thought of when you&#039;re going to send out your invitations?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875814,"PostDate":1413403708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278277\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278277-ak15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AK15<\/span><\/a>! How is the wedding planning going?\u00a0Have you thought of when you're going to send out your invitations?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">\"I Would Gladly Live Out Of A Suitcase If It Meant I Could See The World.\"<\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kennyandaliciawedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.173.226.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375536036,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272208.jpg?_r=1403268709","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeeLee1106","Id":272208,"Name":"LeeLee1106","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.15.30.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77134,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6f539bf3e363a854a05c6b9c9e6f496","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey all, I just got back from our Beaches TCI wedding and have to say it was beyond gorgeous! All of you will LOVE it there (the ocean is unlike anything I&#039;ve ever seen!) and the wedding process is very smooth. You will have no regrets. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879350,"PostDate":1417363338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey all, I just got back from our Beaches TCI wedding and have to say it was beyond gorgeous! All of you will LOVE it there (the ocean is unlike anything I've ever seen!) and the wedding process is very smooth. You will have no regrets. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"novangel2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.104.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389722602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276075.jpg?_r=1389724009","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"novangel","Id":276075,"Name":"novangel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.173.224.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77134,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"844c6b09db8bccd0f2fdc99be13876f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@novangel   Congratulations!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad to hear you had a great time and a beautiful wedding!! Do you have any tips?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880858,"PostDate":1419091839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@novangel\u00a0\u00a0 Congratulations!\u00a0 I'm glad to hear you had a great time and a beautiful wedding!! Do you have any tips?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">\"I Would Gladly Live Out Of A Suitcase If It Meant I Could See The World.\"<\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kennyandaliciawedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.173.226.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375536036,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272208.jpg?_r=1403268709","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeeLee1106","Id":272208,"Name":"LeeLee1106","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.54.223.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77134,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d0e6229504b06391bca94a85db2217e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello fellow Beaches Turks &amp;amp; Caicos Brides-to-be! &amp;nbsp;Our special day is set for 11\/07\/2015!! &amp;nbsp;We&#039;ve been planning this for 2 years now! &amp;nbsp;We&#039;ve already visited the resort for our pre-wedding visit! &amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894570,"PostDate":1430155376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello fellow Beaches Turks & Caicos Brides-to-be! \u00a0Our special day is set for 11\/07\/2015!! \u00a0We've been planning this for 2 years now! \u00a0We've already visited the resort for our pre-wedding visit! \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"labellavita8308@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"174.54.223.216","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1408030388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"labellavita8308","Id":279437,"Name":"labellavita8308","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.159.160.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77134,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"845aaba4134efbc7761b57a2897a33ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We were married there and it was WONDERFUL! Can&#039;t wait to go back just for a visit. If you have children that are going to be a part of the festivities, then this is the way to go. No one was bored and everyone enjoyed themselves to the max!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900309,"PostDate":1436763353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We were married there and it was WONDERFUL! Can't wait to go back just for a visit. If you have children that are going to be a part of the festivities, then this is the way to go. No one was bored and everyone enjoyed themselves to the max!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Beaches Turks & Caicos - 30 Rooms booked with 80 guests confirmed so far!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrskwblocker@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.66.70.123","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1335052688,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254337.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kisha311","Id":254337,"Name":"kisha311","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
