> User Lingling (285622)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":225,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907611,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284291,"Name":"courtneylauren17","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284291.jpg?_r=1450400576","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1447704419,"LastPoster":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1907611,"PostDate":1447704419,"PostContent":"Hi ladies!! My Fiance and I are getting married at the IRHB on January 17, 2017! I have seen some...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneyllyons@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.8.139.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438779859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284291.jpg?_r=1450400576","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"courtneylauren17","Id":284291,"Name":"courtneylauren17","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.8.139.143","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79743,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73b53e2227ed2c8679b3798396af5db4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies!!\n\n\nMy Fiance and I are getting married at the IRHB on January 17, 2017! I have seen some photos of the different ceremony locations but mostly of the Beach ceremony. Has anyone been married on the terrace or in the gardens with photos? I would love to see them as my fiance and I dont feel like stomping around in the sand but want the romance of the gardens perhaps....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, we are opting on a private restaurant for dinner and the pictures I have seen are also very difficult to tell what sort of decorations I could bring \/ use without the place looking silly. Is there enough room for a dance floor and DJ as well as all of the guests and dinner tables!? I am beginning to stress as I just want to be able to see what everything looks like set up!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907611,"PostDate":1447704419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!!<br><br>\nMy Fiance and I are getting married at the IRHB on January 17, 2017! I have seen some photos of the different ceremony locations but mostly of the Beach ceremony. Has anyone been married on the terrace or in the gardens with photos? I would love to see them as my fiance and I dont feel like stomping around in the sand but want the romance of the gardens perhaps....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, we are opting on a private restaurant for dinner and the pictures I have seen are also very difficult to tell what sort of decorations I could bring \/ use without the place looking silly. Is there enough room for a dance floor and DJ as well as all of the guests and dinner tables!? I am beginning to stress as I just want to be able to see what everything looks like set up!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneyllyons@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.8.139.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438779859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284291.jpg?_r=1450400576","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"courtneylauren17","Id":284291,"Name":"courtneylauren17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.179.187.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79743,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ba765f5a852c3902239fcb59682a5e4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"courtneylauren17\"]! I got married at Suites, but which restaurant you can use for your reception is based on how many guests you have. So basically they&#039;ll choose for you, which is good and bad. How many guests do you have? It should say on your paperwork which restaurant fits your number of guests, and that would leave room for a DJ\/dancing I&#039;m sure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I can send you some pictures of ours, even though it was at Suites. We had 67 guests. We had chair sashes, tall floral centerpieces on half of the tables, hurricane vase candles on the others, and framed table numbers. And that was it! My advice is keep it simple. People are so excited to be in Jamaica and having so much fun that they don&#039;t even notice. The expectations for traditional weddings are pretty much out the window for destination weddings so you can do whatever you want. I did not want to lug a ton of stuff down there - I already felt like what we brought was a pain!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907759,"PostDate":1448130788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284291\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284291-courtneylauren17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">courtneylauren17<\/span><\/a>! I got married at Suites, but which restaurant you can use for your reception is based on how many guests you have. So basically they'll choose for you, which is good and bad. How many guests do you have? It should say on your paperwork which restaurant fits your number of guests, and that would leave room for a DJ\/dancing I'm sure.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can send you some pictures of ours, even though it was at Suites. We had 67 guests. We had chair sashes, tall floral centerpieces on half of the tables, hurricane vase candles on the others, and framed table numbers. And that was it! My advice is keep it simple. People are so excited to be in Jamaica and having so much fun that they don't even notice. The expectations for traditional weddings are pretty much out the window for destination weddings so you can do whatever you want. I did not want to lug a ton of stuff down there - I already felt like what we brought was a pain!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79743","Title":"Iberostar Rose Hall Beach Ceremony \/ Reception Photos!?","LastPostDate":1448130788},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
