re from my 10\/2 Secrets Wild orchid wedding.&amp;nbsp; For those who are curious about the quality of photography that&#039;s included in their packages, this is what you are working with.&amp;nbsp; I am pretty satisfied.&amp;nbsp; They took 451 photos and pretty much captured each moment from the ceremony, cocktail hour and the reception.&amp;nbsp; Let me know if you have any questions.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":34183,"Name":"1990288.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-282051-0-72619700-1445342697.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-282051-0-72619700-1445342697_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":34184,"Name":"1990098.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-282051-0-41497300-1445342731.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-282051-0-41497300-1445342731_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667}],"Id":1906593,"PostDate":1445342994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've been trying to get some pics on here from my 10\/2 Secrets Wild orchid wedding.\u00a0 For those who are curious about the quality of photography that's included in their packages, this is what you are working with.\u00a0 I am pretty satisfied.\u00a0 They took 451 photos and pretty much captured each moment from the ceremony, cocktail hour and the reception.\u00a0 Let me know if you have any questions.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soon2bmzbrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.82.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423512700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Soon2bmzbrooks","Id":282051,"Name":"Soon2bmzbrooks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46c83f632025dc6f33ca150530dc062a","RawContent":"Lovely. Your dress is gorgeous :) congrats \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1906605,"PostDate":1445349217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lovely. Your dress is gorgeous <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> congrats <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79667,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97742f8e9e1cded081ab8c5192dcefc9","RawContent":"I love your dress too!!  Can&#039;t wait to see more pictures. \n\nI was wondering who and how much did you tip everybody?","Attachments":[],"Id":1906709,"PostDate":1445501403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n  